              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MRSW00DY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Super good. Super easy! I did not taste the root beer. I was happy about that. Very subtle flavors. If you have people sensitive to hot food, you might want to leave out the red pepper flakes. I'm looking forward to using different sodas to see the taste change:)",
